{
  "title": "Ethereal Vine",
  "pageid": 109388,
  "fetchedAt": "2026-07-28T10:42:03.681Z",
  "wikitext": "{{Infobox/Item\n|rarity=e\n|auctionable = n\n|salable = y\n|sell = 20000\n|bazaar = ETHEREAL_VINE\n|id=ETHEREAL_VINE\n}}\nAn '''Ethereal Vine''' is an {{Epic}} item.\n\n== Obtaining ==\nAn '''Ethereal Vine''' can be found when harvesting a [[Mutations|Mutation]] in the [[Greenhouse]]. The odds depend on [[Mutations|Mutation]] rarity and are as follows:\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n!Mutation Rarity\n!Chance\n|-\n|{{Common}}\n|{{Green|15%}}\n|-\n|{{Uncommon}}\n|{{Green|20%}}\n|-\n|{{Rare}}\n|{{Green|25%}}\n|-\n|{{Epic}}\n|{{Green|30%}}\n|-\n|{{Legendary}}\n|{{Green|40%}}\n|} \n\nAdditionally, '''Ethereal Vines''' have a {{Green|4%}} ({{Green|1}}/{{Green|25}}){{confirm}} chance to be found when harvesting a crop with additional rolls.\n\n== Usage ==\nAn '''Ethereal Vine''' can be used in the [[Greenhouse]] to unlock more slots. While holding an '''Etheral Vine''', all locked slots on the Greenhouse become red or green terracotta: they can be used on green terracotta, which represents a slot that is adjacent to an unlocked slot. When an '''Ethereal Vine''' is used, the following text appears:\n\n{{Dialogue|\n&aYou use the &5Ethereal Vine &ato free the rooted space, unlocking\n&aa new planting slot!\n}}\n\n=== Garden Upgrades ===\n{{RD|100 Ethereal Vine}} and {{RD|150 Ethereal Vine}} is needed to unlock a second and third [[Greenhouse]], respectively. They both come with all plots unlocked.\n\n== Tips ==\n\n* If buying '''Ethereal Vines''' from the Bazaar is not an option, growing mutations with the Bonus Drop effects is a cheap and viable alternative.\n** [[Gloomgourd|Gloomgourds]] are a great option, requiring only a Pumpkin and Watermelon nearby. Ensure that many of them can grow close together to share their Bonus Drop trait with one another.\n\n== History ==\n{{History table\n|ahn=\n{{History|2025/Dec 5|[[File:Ethereal Vine.png|26px]] Added '''Ethereal Vine'''.}}\n|beta=\n{{History|2025/Dec 15|[[File:Ethereal Vine.png|26px]] Added '''Ethereal Vine'''.}}\n}}",
