  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Ethereal Vine</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Ethereal_Vine.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ethereal Vine.png\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Vine.png\" src=\"/images/Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"epic\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;5Ethereal Vine\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Allows you to unlock additional plant/&amp;7slots in the &amp;aGreenhouse &amp;7by/&amp;7right-clicking on a locked plant slot.//&amp;8&amp;oThis elusive vine seems to grow/&amp;8&amp;owherever it pleases, bending the/&amp;8&amp;orules of nature.//&amp;5&amp;lEPIC\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Ethereal Vine\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Vine.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/32px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/64px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-