the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">???</span></abbr></span></sup></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Sell</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-bazaar=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJwcm9kdWN0RGF0YSIsImRhdGF0eXBlIjoic2VsbCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsInByb2R1Y3RJZCI6IkVUSEVSRUFMX1ZJTkUifQ==\" class=\"bazaar-data-placeholder bazaar-data-operation-productData\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;coins</span></abbr></span><sup><span data-bazaar=\"eyJsb25nIjpmYWxzZSwicHJvZHVjdElkIjoiRVRIRVJFQUxfVklORSIsIm9wZXJhdGlvbiI6InByaWNlQ2hhbmdlIiwiZm9ybWF0IjoiaWNvbm9ubHkiLCJkYXRhdHlwZSI6InNlbGwifQ==\" class=\"bazaar-data-placeholder bazaar-data-operation-priceChange\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">???</span></abbr></span></sup></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div><b>Price Spread: </b><span data-bazaar=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJwcmljZVNwcmVhZCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsInByb2R1Y3RJZCI6IkVUSEVSRUFMX1ZJTkUifQ==\" class=\"bazaar-data-placeholder bazaar-data-operation-priceSpread\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>ETHEREAL_VINE</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>An <b>Ethereal Vine</b> is an <span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Garden_Upgrades\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Garden Upgrades</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Tips\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tips</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>An <b>Ethereal Vine</b> can be found when harvesting a <a href=\"/w/Mutations\" title=\"Mutations\">Mutation</a> in the <a href=\"/w/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\">Greenhouse</a>. The odds depend on <a href=\"/w/Mutations\" title=\"Mutations\">Mutation</a> rarity and are as follows:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Mutation Rarity\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"0\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Common\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">COMMON</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">15%</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Uncommon\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">UNCOMMON</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">20%</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">25%</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">30%</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">40%</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Additionally, <b>Ethereal Vines</b> have a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">4%</span> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>/<span class=\"light-color color-green\">25</span>)<sup><i>&#91;<abbr title=\"Confirmation needed; When this info is confirmed, remove this.\">Confirm</abbr>&#93;</i></sup> chance to be found when harvesting a crop with additional rolls.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>An <b>Ethereal Vine</b> can be used in the <a href=\"/w/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\">Greenhouse</a> to unlock more slots. While holding an <b>Etheral Vine</b>, all locked slots on the Greenhouse become red or green terracotta: they can be used on green terracotta, which represents a slot that is adjacent to an unlocked slot. When an <b>Ethereal Vine</b> is used, the following text appears:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">You use the </span><span class=\"format-5\">Ethereal Vine </span><span class=\"format-a\">to free the rooted space, unlocking</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">a new planting slot!</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Garden_Upgrades\">Garden Upgrades</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Garden Upgrades\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Garden Upgrades\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine\" title=\"Ethereal Vine\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Vine\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/21px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/42px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<abbr title=\"1 stack plus 36 (100 in total)\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">100x</span></abbr>&#160;<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ethereal Vine</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine\" title=\"Ethereal Vine\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Vine\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/21px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/42px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<abbr title=\"2 stacks plus 22 (150 in total)\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">150x</span></abbr>&#160;<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ethereal Vine</a> is needed to unlock a second and third <a href=\"/w/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\">Greenhouse</a>, respectively. They both come with all plots unlocked.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tips\">Tips</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Tips\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Tips\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>If buying <b>Ethereal Vines</b> from the Bazaar is not an option, growing mutations with the Bonus Drop effects is a cheap and viable alternative.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Gloomgourd\" title=\"Gloomgourd\">Gloomgourds</a> are a great option, requiring only a Pumpkin and Watermelon nearby. Ensure that many of them can grow close together to share their Bonus Drop trait with one another.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ethereal_Vine?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_5\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 5\">Dec&#160;5,&#160;2025</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Ethereal_Vine.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/26px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/52px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <b>Ethereal Vine</b>.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_15\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 15\">Dec&#160;15,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.24</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Ethereal_Vine.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/26px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ethereal_Vine.png/52px-Ethereal_Vine.png?8617c 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <b>Ethereal Vine</b>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐67dcd84dcf‐s2scv\nCached time: 20260727204125\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 1.935 seconds\nReal time usage: 5.230 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 408/1000000\nRevision size: 1929/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 20658/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 739/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/50\nBucket time usage: 0.000/10 seconds\nLua time usage: 1.710/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 30106293/367001600 bytes\nLua Profile:\n    ?                                                                560 ms       32.6%\n    validateData <mw.lua:825>                                         80 ms        4.7%\n    format                                                            80 ms        4.7%\n    (for generator)                                                   80 ms        4.7%\n    type                                                              60 ms     